What you might not immediately think of is that you can also support us through a legacy gift. As a foundation with ANBI status, Quina Care is exempt from inheritance tax, which means your entire legacy can be used for our mission.

Are you considering leaving a legacy to Quina Care and would you like more information or have questions? Feel free to contact our treasurer, Yvonne van der Ende.

